OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 1 JAN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GSemyon Byckov conducts the Royal
OL,6,     GStockholm Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,7,     Gplaying Dvorak's Ninth Symphony,
OL,8,     Gand they are joined by violinist
OL,9,     GMaria Duenas for Mendelssohn's
OL,10,     GViolin Concerto.
OL,11,G2115FThe Lebrecht Interview
OL,12,     GNorman Lebrecht talks to
OL,13,     Gconductor Marin Alsop about her
OL,14,     Glife and career, from being
OL,15,     Gmentored by Leonard Bernstein to
OL,16,     Gher recording ambitions.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
